# ReliefNet — Full-Stack AI Platform: Implementation Plan
## (Local Development Only)

## Overview

Builds the production-grade ReliefNet software platform from the existing notebook pipeline output.
**No Docker. No deployment config. Pure local development.**

---

## Notebook Dataset Reference

### Source Datasets (Input to Notebook)

| Dataset | Path | Format | Key Fields |
|---|---|---|---|
| **EM-DAT Disaster Events** | `data/raw/emdat/*.csv` | CSV | `dis_no`, `year`, `start_month`, `end_month`, `disaster_type`, `disaster_subtype`, `province`, `district`, `total_deaths`, `total_affected`, `total_damage_usd`, `latitude`, `longitude` |
| **NFHS-5 Health Indicators** | `data/raw/govdata/*.csv/.xlsx` | CSV/Excel | `nfhs_stunting_pct`, `nfhs_underweight_pct`, `nfhs_anemia_children`, `nfhs_institutional_birth` |
| **Infrastructure Dataset** | `data/raw/govdata/*.csv` | CSV | `state`, `district`, `population`, `area_sq_km`, `num_hospitals`, `num_warehouses`, `num_shelters`, `shelter_capacity_total`, `num_telecom_towers`, `road_length_km`, `num_bridges`, `has_airport`, `has_railway`, `river_proximity_km`, `coastal_district`, `avg_elevation_m` |
| **Warehouse Inventory** | embedded in infra CSV | CSV | `warehouse_rice_tons`, `warehouse_wheat_tons`, `warehouse_medicine_kits`, `warehouse_tarpaulin_units` |
| **GIS Shapefiles / GeoJSON** | `data/raw/gis/` | Shapefile / GeoJSON | District polygons in EPSG:4326 |
| **LGD District Master** | Hard-coded in notebook | Python list | `state`, `district_canonical`, `lgd_code` (e.g. `MH_001`, `KL_002`) |

> The notebook generates **synthetic versions** of all datasets when real files are absent. Backend works identically with synthetic or real data.

### Notebook Export Outputs (Backend reads these)

| File | Path | Used By |
|---|---|---|
| `reliefnet_district_features.csv` | `data/exports/` | Data loader → `districts` collection |
| `reliefnet_district_features.parquet` | `data/exports/` | ML services |
| `reliefnet_disasters.csv` | `data/exports/` | Data loader → `disasters` collection |
| `reliefnet_disasters.parquet` | `data/exports/` | ML services |
| `reliefnet_road_edges.csv` | `data/exports/` | Data loader → `road_network` collection |
| `district_mapping_report.csv` | `data/reports/` | Debug / admin UI |
| `validation_report.json` | `data/reports/` | Admin dashboard |

### Engineered Feature Matrix (Exact Column Schema)

```
# Identity
district, state, lgd_code, latitude, longitude

# Raw Infrastructure
population, area_sq_km, num_hospitals, num_warehouses, num_shelters,
shelter_capacity_total, num_telecom_towers, road_length_km, num_bridges,
has_airport, has_railway, river_proximity_km, coastal_district, avg_elevation_m

# NFHS-5 Health
nfhs_stunting_pct, nfhs_underweight_pct, nfhs_anemia_children, nfhs_institutional_birth

# Warehouse Stock
warehouse_rice_tons, warehouse_wheat_tons, warehouse_medicine_kits, warehouse_tarpaulin_units

# Engineered — Density/Access
population_density, hospital_density_per_1000sqkm, shelter_capacity_per_1000,
telecom_density_per_100sqkm, transport_accessibility

# Engineered — Risk
flood_risk_score [0-1], health_vulnerability [0-1], warehouse_supply_per_capita

# Engineered — Historical (from EM-DAT)
disaster_frequency, total_deaths_historical, total_affected_historical,
total_damage_usd_historical, historical_damage_score [0-1], avg_recency_weight

# Engineered — Road Network (from NetworkX graph)
network_degree, betweenness_centrality, avg_road_failure_prob [0-1],
max_road_failure_prob [0-1], is_isolated

# Engineered — Spatial
nearest_warehouse_km

# Vulnerability Index
vulnerability_score [0-1], vulnerability_score_pca [0-1],
vulnerability_tier (LOW|MEDIUM|HIGH|CRITICAL)

# UAV & Logistics
uav_reachable_within_range, uav_terrain_penalty [0-1],
truck_estimated_hours, truck_accessibility_score [0-1],
disconnected_region_score [0-1],
preferred_delivery_mode (truck|uav|both|emergency_airlift)
```

### Road Network Edge Schema

```
source, target                  — district names
distance_km                     — Euclidean distance
flood_risk                      — edge flood exposure score
landslide_risk                  — elevation-difference risk
failure_probability             — combined edge failure probability [0-1]
```

### Disaster Event Schema (EM-DAT enriched)

```
dis_no, year, start_month, end_month, disaster_type, disaster_subtype,
country, province, district, district_canonical, district_lgd_code,
total_deaths, total_affected, total_damage_usd, latitude, longitude,
disaster_start_date, disaster_end_date, disaster_duration_days,
season (Monsoon|Post-Monsoon|Winter|Pre-Monsoon), decade, recency_weight
```

