## Verification Plan

### Backend
```bash
cd backend
pytest tests/ -v --asyncio-mode=auto
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
# Open http://localhost:8000/docs → test all endpoints via Swagger UI
```

### Frontend
```bash
cd frontend
npm run dev
# Open http://localhost:5173 → verify all pages render
```

### Data Load Verification
```bash
python -m app.core.data_loader --export-dir ../data/exports/
# Check MongoDB Atlas / Compass: all 11 collections populated
```

