## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Real Data Files**: Do you have real EM-DAT, NFHS-5, or GIS files to put in `data/raw/`? The backend works with synthetic data from the notebook but real files give accurate scores.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **MongoDB**: Do you have MongoDB Community Edition already installed locally, or should I include setup instructions?

> [!NOTE]
> **LGD Coverage**: The notebook uses a ~50-district sample. Full India coverage needs the complete LGD CSV (~750 districts). Starting with the 50-district sample is fine for development.
